                <invention-title lang="de">VERFAHREN ZUR HERSTELLUNG VON REZYKLIERTEN POLYMEREN</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉ DE PRÉPARATION DE POLYMÈRES RECYCLÉS</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">METHOD FOR PREPARING RECYCLED POLYMERS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Provided is a method of preparing a recycled polymer including: (S1) supplying cycloalkyl alkyl ether as a solvent to a dissolution tank and a precipitation tank, respectively; (S2) supplying a composite resin to the dissolution tank, heating to a dissolution temperature, and dissolving a polymer included in the composite resin while maintaining the dissolution tank at the dissolution temperature to obtain a polymer solution; (S3) supplying the polymer solution to the precipitation tank in which the solvent is maintained at a precipitation temperature and precipitating the polymer included in the polymer solution to obtain a solution including a polymer precipitate; and (S4) filtering the solution including the polymer precipitate to obtain the polymer precipitate.</p>
            </abstract>
